[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#LILLY
(Why does it hurt to think about him? Seeing her with him… it’s like a knife, but it’s also… exciting. I’m such a mess.)[p]
(I keep imagining myself in her place, feeling his hands, his… ugh, stop it, Lilly. You can’t think like this.)[p]

#LILLY
(But now he’s going to school—*my* school. I’ll see him there, every day, so close… maybe he’ll notice me.)[p]
(I shouldn’t want that. Lisa would hate me if she knew. I’m betraying her just by feeling this way.)[p]

#LILLY
(I need to hurry—Zack’s driving me to school. Oh God, sitting next to him in the car, after… after *that*? I don’t know if I can keep it together.)[p]
(Just act normal, Lilly. Smile, be sweet, don’t let him see how much you’re burning inside. You can’t let this ruin everything.)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

